* ============================================================================
* TLV9001 - behavioural model for LTspice
*
* Written the same way as this project's MCP6241.lib (smooth gm-C model with a
* tanh slew limit and a gain-node rail clamp), so the two can be compared
* like for like. It is NOT TI's macromodel.
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* DATASHEET VALUES MODELLED   (TI SBOS833R, TLV9001/2/4, Nov 2021)
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*   Gain bandwidth product ...... 1 MHz (VS = 5 V)       -> CC1 = 159.15 pF
*   Slew rate ................... 2 V/us (VS = 5 V)      -> BG1 limit = 318.3 uA
*   Open loop gain .............. 104 dB min (117 typ)  -> RG1 = 158 MEG (104 dB)
*   Output swing ................ 10 mV typ from rails (RL 10k) -> clamped 10 mV
*   Input common mode ........... (V-) - 0.1 V to (V+) + 0.1 V (rail-to-rail)
*   Input bias current .......... 5 pA                  -> 1e12 input resistors
*   Input capacitance ........... 5 pF common mode
*   Quiescent current ........... 60 uA typ             -> IQ
*   Input offset voltage ........ 0 (typical case). Datasheet max +/-1.6 mV
*                                 (MCP6241: +/-5 mV).
*   Phase margin 78 deg (G = 1) and the 40 mA short-circuit limit are not
*   modelled (neither are they in MCP6241.lib).
*
* Supply 1.8 V to 5.5 V (absolute maximum 7 V), as the MCP6241.
* Pinout of TLV9001IDBVR (SOT-23-5, "DBV", not the "U" variant): 1 OUT, 2 V-,
* 3 IN+, 4 IN-, 5 V+ - the same as MCP6241T-E/OT.
*
* PIN ORDER (as MCP6241.lib):  In+  In-  V+  V-  OUT
* ============================================================================
.SUBCKT TLV9001 1 2 3 4 5
* input stage: gm = 1 mA/V, smooth slew limit at 318.3 uA -> 2 V/us into CC1
BG1 0 10 I=318.3u*tanh(1m*(V(1)-V(2))/318.3u)
* dominant pole: GBW = gm/(2*pi*CC1) = 1 MHz, Avol = gm*RG1 = 158000 (104 dB)
RG1 10 0 158MEG
CC1 10 0 159.15p
* gain-node rail clamp (wind-up fix, as in MCP6241.lib)
BCL 10 0 I=1e-2*(0.5*((V(10)-V(3)-0.1)+sqrt((V(10)-V(3)-0.1)*(V(10)-V(3)-0.1)+1e-6))-0.5*((V(4)-0.1-V(10))+sqrt((V(4)-0.1-V(10))*(V(4)-0.1-V(10))+1e-6)))
* input impedance
RIN1 1 0 1E12
RIN2 2 0 1E12
CIN1 1 0 5P
CIN2 2 0 5P
* output stage: rail-to-rail, 10 mV inside the supplies
BE1 11 0 V=max(min(V(10),V(3)-0.01),V(4)+0.01)
RO1 11 5 10
* quiescent supply current
IQ 3 4 60U
.ENDS TLV9001
